#: kcmtaskbar.cpp:200
msgid ""
"<h1>Taskbar</h1> You can configure the taskbar here. This includes options "
"such as whether or not the taskbar should show all windows at once or only "
"those on the current desktop. You can also configure whether or not the "
"Window List button will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Thanh ta'c vu.</h1> Ba.n co' the^? ca^'u hi`nh thanh ta'c vu. o+? dda^y."
"No' bao go^`m ca'c tuy` cho.n nhu+ thanh ta'c vu. co' hie^?n thi. ta^'t ca?"
"ca'c cu+?a so^? trong cu`ng mo^.t lu'c tre^n desktop hie^.n ta.i hay kho^ng ."
"Ba.n co' the^? ca^'u hi`nh sao cho nu't danh sa'ch ca'c cu+?a so^? co' ddu+o+.c hie^?n"
"thi. hay kho^ng ."

